<messaging:emailTemplate subject="SLA Breached for case {!relatedTo.CaseId__r.CaseNumber}" recipientType="User" relatedToType="CaseSLA__c">
<messaging:htmlEmailBody >
<p>Dear {!relatedTo.Owner.Name},</p>

<p>The  Case SLA for the following case <a href="https://modonproperties.lightning.force.com//{!relatedTo.Id}">{!relatedTo.CaseId__r.CaseNumber}</a> has been breached.</p>

<p>Case Number: {!relatedTo.CaseId__r.CaseNumber}</p>
<p>SLA Breach DueTime: {!relatedTo.DueTime__c}</p>

<p>Please prioritize this and take immediate action to resolve the customer issue.</p>

<p>Best Regards,</p>
<p>Modon Service Team</p>
</messaging:htmlEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>